Mechanical design licensing scope
=================================

SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-P-2.0

Copyright 2026 26-EngBot contributors.

Original mechanical design source created for the 26-EngBot project is
licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Permissive. The full
text is available at:

    ../LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt

This grant applies only to CAD models, drawings, manufacturing exports, and
BOM material for which the 26-EngBot contributors hold the necessary rights.

It does not relicense downloaded or imported supplier/manufacturer models,
RoboMaster referee-system models, component models, archived reference
assemblies, logos, datasheets, or any other third-party material. Such files
remain subject to their original terms. If ownership or provenance of a file
cannot be established, no permission beyond applicable law should be inferred
from its presence in this repository.

When conveying a modified covered design, retain applicable notices and add a
notice recording the date and a brief description of the modification, as
required by CERN-OHL-P-2.0 section 3.3.
